@host = http://localhost:7102
@email = xml-example@example.com
@password = Example-password1
@tourId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Valid typed registration (establishes the authentication cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Invalid typed registration
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### Valid typed route request
POST {{host}}/api/routes/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromLatitude": 48.2082,
  "fromLongitude": 16.3738,
  "toLatitude": 52.52,
  "toLongitude": 13.405,
  "transportType": "Car"
}

### Invalid typed route request (latitude and transport type)
POST {{host}}/api/routes/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromLatitude": 91,
  "fromLongitude": 16.3738,
  "toLatitude": 52.52,
  "toLongitude": 13.405,
  "transportType": "Train"
}

### Valid XML tour import in the typed JSON envelope
POST {{host}}/api/reports/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "xml": "<tour><name>Vienna City Ride</name><description>Imported XML example</description><from>Vienna</from><to>Vienna</to><imagePath xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:nil=\"true\" /><routeInformation xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:nil=\"true\" /><distance>12.5</distance><estimatedTime>45</estimatedTime><transportType>Bike</transportType><tourLog><dateTime>2026-08-02T10:00:00Z</dateTime><comment>Clear weather</comment><difficulty>2</difficulty><totalDistance>12.5</totalDistance><totalTime>45</totalTime><rating>5</rating></tourLog></tour>"
}

### Invalid XML tour import (unknown element)
POST {{host}}/api/reports/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "xml": "<tour><name>Invalid Tour</name><description>Unknown node</description><from>Vienna</from><to>Berlin</to><transportType>Car</transportType><unknown>true</unknown></tour>"
}

### Export a tour as application/xml
GET {{host}}/api/reports/export/{{tourId}}
Accept: application/xml
